        "created_at": "2020-07-15T12:51:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was also surprised by getting to use the power twice. I think it's just each hero can only use each power once per turn?</p>\n<p>Regardless, I had no issues with this either even though I probably messed up a number of times with less than optimal plays. Tempest spent most of the game just destroying his own cards in Chokepoint's play area, but that meant he was already ready to deal with her ongoings!</p>",
