        "created_at": "2020-07-15T13:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s a ruling we got from Fireside chats:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Fireside Chats\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Fireside Chats:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br>\nWhen cards like Character Witness and Called to Judgement allow the players to use the power on the character card next to Representative of Earth, it does not matter if that power has already been used that turn. Like Pride and Prejudice, they are being specifically told to use that power now.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:30.714Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
